Package: com.ratush.cchppe
Name: CCHPM
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Control Center tile for Hidden Photos Manager. Turns the whole tweak on and off (the same master switch as Settings -> Hidden Photos Manager -> Enable), so you can disable or re-enable it without opening Settings. Add the tile in Settings -> Control Center.
Maintainer: chelaxian
Author: chelaxian
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, com.ratush.hppe, com.opa334.ccsupport
Recommends: com.ratush.hppe
